reac-pw (1.0.34) unstable; urgency=medium

  * release.yml: the publish commits sign with the organisation's commit key
    (#32)
  * release.yml: name the secrets the shared workflows read; inherit carries
    nothing across organisations (#32)
  * release.yml: grant the permissions the shared build workflows need
  * test_reac_served_mark: assertions read interfaces the test added, so none
    is NULL
  * reac-pw 1.0.34
  * Ship reac-pw-nm-unmanaged: keep NetworkManager off the interfaces reac-pw
    serves
  * Mark every interface a segment comes up on with the alias reac-pw:served
  * Remove CHANGELOG.md and its CI check; git history is the changelog
  * reac-pw 1.0.33
  * reac-capture stops being the door when reac-playback comes back
  * CHANGELOG: a box with no outputs has no sink (#13)
  * A box with no outputs has no sink, and its door is reac-capture

 -- Pau Aliagas <linuxnow@gmail.com>  Sat, 24 Oct 2026 16:18:34 +0000
